        },
        {
          "text": " Aso do, keŋaiŋait, kiyapoikinoi eoŋ, kolimitos EJAKAIT, naarai kekonak yes nukasianut, yes da kikonakis ekaloka papaka nukasianut, koinakis eoŋ aanyunet nakabeit: ",
