            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ejaun do ebe, nin yenelomuni kotogokon alosit orot, ejaunos aokotoke akouke, emamuunete nukibeikinete sio: ŋin yenejai kajo togo, ejaunos aokotoke akoukosi, arai kesuroki ŋes adiokan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
