              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kotema ŋesi atiar, “Kikote nepenen, kwape ejaatar akusikiro.” Kotwar kes, konyout: koenik auno nakareŋan adirisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.21",
